title: IntroScene
position: -155,-232
---

The game opens on a dimly lit, smoke-filled room. Five men sit at a table facing a stage.

FirstGuy: Next contestant!

A man walks onto the stage.

Man: First let me say how incredible it is to be in the presence of such illustrious men! Don Contento!

Don Contento: AYYYYYY!

Man: Don Lacrimoso!

Don Lacrimoso: Aw, forget it.

Man: Don Calvo!

Don Calvo: You just call me Baldo?!

Man: Don Bill!

Don Bill: hi, i'm bill.

Man: Don Espresso!

Don Espresso: HEYHOWYADOINREALLYGREATTOBEHERELET’SGETONWITHIT

Man: As you’ll see at your table, my resumé is filled with service to the families...

<<show_resume>>
Don Calvo: Wait, Boba was you?

Man: Yeah, it was. Wh-

<<play_sound "gunshot">>
The man is shot dead.

Don Calvo: My kid loved Boba. Cried for three days.

Don Lacrimoso: We’re gonna be here all week at this rate…

Don Espresso: SORRYGUYSIGOTTAGO!

Don Bill: again?

Don Contento: It’s fine!

Don Calvo: Oof, madone!

Don Espresso runs off.

The camera cuts to you and a headset person in another room.

Headset person: Alright, you’re up next, uhhhhh, what was your name again?

<<declare $playerName = "nobody">>

Headset person: Ok {$playerName}, you’ve got about 20 minutes to look around.

-> explore the room
    <<jump ExploreRoom>>
